// Background suite — does the model pick the right way to run something long?
// NOT part of the gate. Run after touching the bash / monitor descriptions,
// on a weak and a strong model (see delegation.jsonl for the commands).
//   - watching a long run for a specific line -> `monitor` with a pattern
//   - a process that never exits -> bash run_in_background
// Sandboxed: both tools are mutating, so explore mode would hide them. The
// runner kills the trial's background shells at cleanup.
